  "content_html": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/9a2d7f062f88b56a24.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"ציור של עיפרון מונח מעל תשבץ\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"167\" data-original-width=\"162\" src=\"/assets/images/content/9a2d7f062f88b56a24.png\" /></a></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial;\">(פתרונות בסוף הפוסט...)</span></span><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><a name=\"more\" style=\"background: transparent; color: #132a53; cursor: pointer;\"></a></span></div><span><!--more--></span><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif;\"><h2 style=\"margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">התאמה מושלמת</span></span></h2></div><div style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">התאימו בין 2 חלקי הביטויים המופיעים בפרשה:</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אבן........צפון</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ויסעו......אֵתָם</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מדבר....תמרים</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הֹר........ויחנו</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הר........יד</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הרי.......ההר</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בעל......גבר</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שִׁבְעִים..הָעֲבָרִים</span></span></p><p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"line-height: 1.6667; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">עציון.....שָׁפֶר</span></p><h2 style=\"margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">הוא והיא - במסעות</span></span></h2><h2><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: right;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הוא<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"> - קנה על שפת נחל / </span>היא<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"> -&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">מקום חניה</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הוא<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"> - שיער העין / </span>היא<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"> - מקום חניה</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הוא<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;- דתי /&nbsp;</span>היא<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;- מקום חניה</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הוא<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;- בעל תפקיד בוותיקן /&nbsp;</span>היא<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;- מקום חניה</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הוא<span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">מִדְבָּר</span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;/&nbsp;</span></span>היא<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">מקום חניה</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הוא<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;- תואר לאדון /&nbsp;</span>היא<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-weight: 400;\">מקום חניה</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הוא<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;- חותן יעקב /&nbsp;</span>היא<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;- מקום חניה</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הוא<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;- קיבוץ ליד נהריה /&nbsp;</span>היא<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;- מקום חניה</span></span></li></ol></div></h2><div><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 20px;\"></p><div><h2 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">מדרגאות</span></span></h2><div><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"background-color: white;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span><span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoratio